OL,3,GNEWSA'Leave us alone, just let us run'
OL,4,A- the women harassed and followed by
OL,5,Amen at night
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Just leave us alone - let us run.
OL,9,F"What can we do? What more can we do to
OL,10,Fstop this? To have the safe, empowering
OL,11,Fspace that we need."
OL,13,FGwen Owen is the founder of a
OL,14,Fwomen-only running group and has taken
OL,15,Fto Instagram to express her despair at
OL,16,F"intimidating" harassment she and Mon
OL,17,FGirls Run receive from men at night.
OL,19,F"We're all glowing, we're in hi-vis, we
OL,20,Fhad our lights on - we wanted to own
OL,21,Fthe night - and we still got harassed."
